    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on the 18th May 2005 the erection of a detached outbuilding within the rear garden to measure 11.750m length by 5.7m width by 2.7m height with a flat roof was lawful within the meaning of Section 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:",
